-- 069 was drafted after Staging PostgREST showed
--   "permission denied for table project_plays" for service_role (and supports).
-- That blocked admin/smoke reconciliation scripts that SELECT project_plays
-- directly. It is NOT required for product runtime:
--   - Public 「プレイヤー N人」 reads via SECURITY DEFINER get_public_project_stats
--     (migration 068); anon/authenticated need EXECUTE only — not table GRANT.
--   - Client play recording uses authenticated upsert on project_plays
--     (recordProjectPlay); that relies on existing table privileges + RLS from
--     engagement setup, not this permanent restore migration.
-- Do not apply to Staging or Production. Kept for history only (renamed .UNUSED).
-- Keep 068. No FB-history relation.
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
